## Context
Implemented the stateless enforcement pass for model evaluations on top of the earlier creating-skills budget policy. The runner now preflights exact stage scope, generated trigger cases avoid blanket three-trial and LLM grading, the workflow is manual-only, and staged summaries invalidate plan/result drift. The complete deterministic suite and creating-skills validator passed without invoking a real model.

